## Decision branches
- defer_live_tactic — when: the target step already has a live tactic this period; then: defer until it has hit or missed its exit criterion
- keep — when: metric at or above baseline + minimum_lift after the rollout; then: keep the tactic, move to the next drop-off
- remove — when: metric below baseline + minimum_lift; then: remove the tactic, return to the drop-off ranking
